[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:3. Please Send Me a Card]
[00:00.740]Passage 3 | 文章三
[00:02.585]Please send me a card. | 请给我寄一张明信片。
[00:06.270]Postcards always spoil my holidays. | 明信片总是破坏我的假期。
[00:11.335]Last summer, I went to Italy. | 去年夏天，我去了意大利。
[00:14.555]I visited museums and sat in public gardens. | 我参观了博物馆，并在公共花园里坐着。
[00:18.970]A friendly waiter taught me a few words of Italian. | 一位友好的服务员教了我几句意大利语。
[00:22.835]Then he lent me a book. | 然后他借给我一本书。
[00:24.945]I read a few lines, but I did not understand a word. | 我读了几行，但一个字也不懂。
[00:29.575]Every day I thought about postcards. | 每天我都在想明信片。
[00:33.720]My holidays passed quickly, but I did not send any cards to my friends. | 我的假期过得很快，但我没有给我的朋友寄任何明信片。
[00:39.670]On the last day, I made a big decision. | 在最后一天，我做了一个重要的决定。
[00:43.735]I got up early and bought thirty-seven cards. | 我很早起床，买了37张明信片。
[00:48.150]I spent the whole day in my room, but I did not write a single card. | 我在房间里呆了一整天，但一张明信片也没写。